  "updated_at": "2026-01-15T14:36:21.172613+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1080/0022250X.1971.9989794",
  "reference": "Schelling, T.C. (1971). Dynamic models of segregation. J Math Sociology 1:143-186. Nobel Prize 2005."
}